### Chat App API Tests

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### ===== AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS =====

### 1. Sign Up
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Check Auth Status (Protected Route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/check
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Update Profile (Protected Route)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/update-profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profilePic": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472099645785-5658abf4ff4e?w=400&h=400&fit=crop&crop=face"
}

### ===== MESSAGE ENDPOINTS =====

### 6. Get Users for Sidebar (Protected Route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/users
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Get Messages with Specific User (Protected Route)
# First get users list, then replace USER_ID_HERE with actual user ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/USER_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Send Message to User (Protected Route)
# First get users list, then replace USER_ID_HERE with actual user ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/send/USER_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello! This is a test message.",
  "image": ""
}

### ===== EXAMPLE WORKFLOW =====

### Step 1: Create a test user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123"
}

### Step 2: Login with test user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123"
}

### Step 3: Check if authenticated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/check
Content-Type: application/json

### Step 4: Get all users for sidebar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/users
Content-Type: application/json

### Step 5: Send a message (replace USER_ID_HERE with actual user ID from step 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/send/USER_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello from test user!",
  "image": ""
}

### Step 6: Get messages with that user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/USER_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

